{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1227444-second-edition-strength-chart","id":1227444,"title":"Second Edition Strength Chart","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-14T08:43:52-07:00","id":1227444,"title":"Second Edition Strength Chart","content":"Does anyone else have a problem with the way strength is being dealt with? First we have to roll to lift anything which seems to go against the theme of &quot;roll when its interesting&quot; but we're also not given any context for what a certain level of strength represents. <br /> <br /> Secondly the chart is REALLY inconsistent. 3 successes allow you to lift two microwaves? really? 10 allow you to lift and throw a car? A human character with strength athletics 10 and the right equipment/situation has a real chance of throwing a car... or of being unable to lift 2 microwaves...not that that ever actually comes up (also, what kind of microwaves are we talking here? 1.1cuft? 2.0cuft?. <br /> <br /> Is this an &quot;easy fix&quot; yeah, I can just borrow from CoD and allow everyone to carry up to their Strength x 25 lbs and use the lifting chart from the same book. it just keeps sticking in my craw that this is an issue at all. I mean, even running speed is accounted for in the movement section and the movement system is FAR more elegant than the lifting one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T07:35:51-07:00","id":1227650,"title":"","content":"I think the thing about &quot;roll when it's interesting&quot; still applies here. It's just a guide for what happens when you do roll. I figure if I were a storyguide, I wouldn't ask you to roll to pick things up unless the act of picking it up was dramatic - if you're just gonna throw the car, and you have Epic Strength, then roll to throw the car. For lifting a big stone door as the room is collapsing, though, that's a roll. Similarly, the athlete you describe would pick up those two microwaves without a roll unless there seems to be a reasonable chance of failure with consequences. Thus, if she's been shot in the arm and wants to throw them in a fight. Could probably still make it, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","name":"CreepyShutIn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T19:13:45-07:00","id":1227800,"title":"","content":"That's fare.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T19:54:4